It is Friday and I wake up in the flat.
Today is my birthday!
I am now thirty-two years old.
I take the U-Bahn to the office.
I expect a completely normal workday.
Later I go into the break room.
My team lead Katrin and my colleague Sven are waiting there for me.
On the table is a large cake.
"Happy birthday, Maya!" they call out.
Sven cuts the cake and brings the coffee.
I am very happy about this surprise.
"Thank you so much, you two!" I say.
"I had absolutely no idea."
Katrin smiles at me.
"That was our plan too," she says.
We eat together and chat.
"You have organized a wonderful morning for me," I say thankfully.
This start to my birthday was simply perfect.
